rooms_desc ({"Here is the hall of Smith's house","Here is the room ... First I tried to furnitureYou can see a small table and two armchairs hereYou can also drink a couple of coffee here","Here is a small kitchen where you can have a lanchThere is a table in the middle of the room and lot of fruits on itYou can see candles on it.Pour yourself a glass of wine and feel good","Here is the bedroom with a bed with baldachim.Candless' light brings you in the world of dreams.The silent music comes from the loudspeakers directly to your earsIt's Bach...You want to sleep.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,0,})
